 "context": "The public hearing formally opens in a large auditorium, with cameras and livestream feeds active and a visible media presence. The moderator notes that the panel's recommendations on the proposed national framework for AI-enabled real-time biometric surveillance in public spaces will be closely watched by policymakers, civil liberties groups, and security agencies.",
